        // Actually, since we're processing one stuffing type at a time, and we want to choose how many buns of this type to make,
        // we can do: for each dough amount j, try adding k buns of this type

        // Better approach: for each dough amount from high to low, and for each possible number of buns
        // But that's O(n * maxBuns * n) which might be too slow

        // Alternative: use the standard bounded knapsack with binary decomposition
        // Or simply: for each dough j from n down to 0, for each k from 1 to maxBuns, if j + k*c <= n, update

